<%- include('header') %><section class="panel"><h1>My facilitator profile / എന്റെ വിവരങ്ങൾ</h1><h2><%= f.full_name %></h2><p><%= f.number %> · <%= f.panchayat_name %> · <%= status %></p><p>Application reference: <%= application.number %> · Valid until <%= f.valid_until %></p><img class="private-image-preview" src="/my/photo/" width="160" height="200" alt="Your approved photograph"><% [2,3,4].forEach(step=>{ %><dl class="review-data"><% fields[step].forEach(field=>{const value=application.data[step]?.[field.name]; %><dt><%= bi(field.label) %></dt><dd><%= Array.isArray(value)?value.join(', '):value||'—' %></dd><% }) %></dl><% }) %><p>For corrections, contact the administrator for a correction link. / തിരുത്തലുകൾക്കുള്ള ലിങ്കിനായി അഡ്മിനിസ്ട്രേറ്ററെ ബന്ധപ്പെടുക.</p></section><section class="panel mt-4"><h2>My ID card / എന്റെ ഐഡി കാർഡ്</h2><% if(currentCard){ %><p><%= currentCard.number %></p><iframe class="id-card-preview" width="480" height="360" src="/my/card/preview/#toolbar=0" title="Your current ID card preview" loading="lazy"></iframe><form method="post" action="/my/card/"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn btn-primary" name="format" value="pdf">Download ID card PDF</button> <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" name="format" value="print_pdf">Download A4 print sheet</button></form><% }else{ %><p>A current ID card is unavailable. Please contact the administrator.</p><% } %></section><%- include('footer') %>